WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:15,970
Next, I tried to use the ionic foot bath, the ion pro wave, and the device that goes into

00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:21,770
the water wasn't lighted up when placed in the water. When I pulled it out, the blue light

00:00:21,770 --> 00:00:29,290
would come on. So, okay, this is not a problem with the ion pro wave. It's a problem with

00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:35,730
the computer. So, if you have a problem with your ion pro wave, something similar to this

00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:41,730
that goes on, I took the water, it goes off, I take it out, it goes on again. It is a Microsoft

00:00:41,730 --> 00:00:48,290
update issue. So, you don't want to run Microsoft updates. You should not have your computer

00:00:48,290 --> 00:00:54,650
connected to the internet. Make sure that your computer is on airplane mode. So, it's not

00:00:54,650 --> 00:01:01,970
trying to run Microsoft updates. But the solution to this is that you boot the computer down

00:01:01,970 --> 00:01:08,210
and you do what's called a hard boot of your computer. Meaning, go to the power button

00:01:08,210 --> 00:01:16,130
on your computer, hold it down for 10 seconds until the computer completely turns off. Wait

00:01:16,130 --> 00:01:23,410
about five minutes, then come back, now turn the button, push the button on again, allow

00:01:23,410 --> 00:01:28,890
it to do a full reboot. That should fix the problem. If you have problems with it, after

00:01:28,890 --> 00:01:38,210
that, make sure you're called Micah truerife. And there could be something wrong, but that

00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:45,810
is 99 out of 100 times it's a Microsoft issue. So, we just need to do a reboot of the computer.

